# impeccable: machine-local only. DESIGN.md, .impeccable/design.json and
# .impeccable/config.json are project artifacts and stay tracked.
# Everything else under .impeccable/ is working evidence — review captures (18MB),
# the critique snapshots and the dev-only status record. This repo is public, so
# they stay on disk and off the remote.
.impeccable/*
/.impeccable/*
!/.impeccable/design.json
!/.impeccable/config.json
/.impeccable/config.local.json

/.omc/*
